## 7. Bonus Points

**a. Did you submit the Bonus "Started Strong" survey by the deadline?**

> **TO FILL IN — Yes / No.**

**b. Did you attempt the extra functionality for bonus points?**

No. Neither the per-process mask nor the pid filter was implemented. The
operation-code interface described in §5.2 was designed to accommodate a pid
filter as an additional `DBGCTL_*` operation without changing the system call
signature, and §5.5 explains why such a filter is the natural remedy for the
scheduler message.
